{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778979922808,"sessionID":"ses_1cc891224ffe8zxLh4LWlOfquh","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_LPQckPqauRuE8UnerIq8dWyt","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://celltype.info/project/544/dataset/1157","format":"markdown","timeout":40},"output":"[![Logo](/_next/static/media/logo.0m_y6rgu7u82u.svg)\n\nCell Annotation Platform\n\n](/)\n\n[Sign In / Join](/auth)\n\n[Explore Datasets](/search/datasets)[Explore Cell Labels](/search/cell-labels)[Blog](/blog)[Docs](/docs)[Contact Us](mailto:support@celltype.info)v2.8.0\n\nSingle cell atlas of the human retina - Bipolar cell subclass - scRNA-seq | CAP\n\n# Single cell atlas of the human retina - Bipolar cell subclass - scRNA-seq\n\nMain\n\n[\n\nSummary\n\n](/project/544/dataset/1157)[\n\nFeedback\n\n](/project/544/dataset/1157/feedback)\n\nCell Metadata\n\n[\n\ncell\\_type\n\n](/project/544/dataset/1157/labelset/18386)\n\n[\n\nauthor\\_cell\\_type\n\n](/project/544/dataset/1157/labelset/18395)\n\n## Summary\n\nOver 72K bipolar cells derived from scRNA-seq datasets were included in the current atlas, which can be divided into 14 cell types based marker genes.\n\n### Metadata\n\nDataset Type\n\nIntegrated. The file includes an integrated collection of datasets.\n\nTotal Cells\n\n72,788\n\ndisease\n\nnormal\n\norganism\n\nHomo sapiens\n\ntissue\n\nfovea centralis (44,169 cells)peripheral region of retina (23,240 cells)chorioretinal region (3,123 cells)retinal neural layer (1,997 cells)macula lutea proper (259 cells)\n\nassay\n\n10x 3' v2 (66,324 cells)10x 3' v3 (6,464 cells)\n\n### Cell Labels\n\n#### [cell\\_type](/project/544/dataset/1157/labelset/18386)\n\nDescription\n\nThe annotated cell type labels for bipolar types.\n\nAnnotation Method\n\nmanual\n\n[![cell_type plot preview](/project/544/dataset/1157/plot-thumbnail?labelset=cell_type&updatedAt=2026-05-16T20%3A41%3A41.293Z)](/project/544/dataset/1157/md)\n\nCell Labels (13)\n\nCells (72,788)\n\n[\n\ninvaginating midget bipolar cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214551)\n\n16,489\n\n[\n\nrod bipolar cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214553)\n\n14,363\n\n[\n\nflat midget bipolar cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214552)\n\n13,299\n\n[\n\ndiffuse bipolar 2 cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214555)\n\n5,536\n\n[\n\ndiffuse bipolar 5](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214558)\n\n4,752\n\n[\n\ndiffuse bipolar 4 cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214560)\n\n4,299\n\n[\n\ndiffuse bipolar 3a cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214559)\n\n3,513\n\n[\n\ndiffuse bipolar 1 cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214556)\n\n2,998\n\n[\n\ngiant bipolar cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214562)\n\n2,378\n\n[\n\ndiffuse bipolar 3b cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214561)\n\n2,336\n\n[\n\ndiffuse bipolar 6 cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214563)\n\n1,836\n\n[\n\nOFFx cell](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214554)\n\n807\n\n#### [author\\_cell\\_type](/project/544/dataset/1157/labelset/18395)\n\nDescription\n\nThis label set was generated by the author using conventional names. It is comparable to another dataset for snRNA-seq studies of bipolar cell subclasses.\n\nAnnotation Method\n\nmanual\n\n[![author_cell_type plot preview](/project/544/dataset/1157/plot-thumbnail?labelset=author_cell_type&updatedAt=2026-05-16T20%3A41%3A41.293Z)](/project/544/dataset/1157/md)\n\nCell Labels (14)\n\nCells (72,788)\n\n[\n\nIMB](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214681)\n\n16,489\n\n[\n\nRB](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214683)\n\n14,363\n\n[\n\nFMB](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214682)\n\n13,299\n\n[\n\nDB2](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214685)\n\n5,536\n\n[\n\nDB5](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214688)\n\n4,752\n\n[\n\nDB4a](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214690)\n\n3,600\n\n[\n\nDB3a](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214689)\n\n3,513\n\n[\n\nDB1](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214686)\n\n2,998\n\n[\n\nGB](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214692)\n\n2,378\n\n[\n\nDB3b](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214691)\n\n2,336\n\n[\n\nDB6](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214693)\n\n1,836\n\n[\n\nOFFx](/project/544/dataset/1157/label/214684)\n\n807\n\n[\n\nMolecular Data\n\n](/project/544/dataset/1157/md)\n\nDownload Dataset\n\n-   [v4](/project/544)\n\nSingle cell atlas of the human retina\n\n-   [Single cell atlas of the human retina - Bipolar cell subclass - scRNA-seq](/project/544/dataset/1157)","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"https://celltype.info/project/544/dataset/1157 (text/html; charset=utf-8)","time":{"start":1778979917054,"end":1778979922805}},"id":"prt_e33774cf5001LAgy5RUkyWwrXF","sessionID":"ses_1cc891224ffe8zxLh4LWlOfquh","messageID":"msg_e337737bb001ucNUDkVxHrfBVY"}}
